    "detailed_description": "A calming adventure where you play as a wiener dog to discover where and who you are. All the while you are free to explore the island and interact with the local population.<br><br>Key features:<br>-A beautifully crafted and calming open world to run, jump and swim through at your own pace.<br>-Meet and interact with the local animals on the island. Some may have found themselves in the exact same place you are now, perhaps they can offer guidance?<br>-Piece together different clues and complete missions for the others on the island to discover a path to another world.<br>-A tailor made story that takes influence from real events to convey a feeling any pet owner has felt before.<br>-A calming hand crafted sound track comprised of acoustic guitars and soothing synth tracks.<br>-Want to adventure under the northern lights or perhaps a setting sun? Gain the ability to change the time of day as you progress through the story.<br>-Barkour! Run and jump to new heights, be it the watchtower overlooking the entire island or the hill crest on the edge of the ocean.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793270/extras/7bb899b860b79035268c5b10203decdb.poster.avif?t=1735781367\" width=240 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793270/extras/7bb899b860b79035268c5b10203decdb.webm?t=1735781367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793270/extras/7bb899b860b79035268c5b10203decdb.mp4?t=1735781367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793270/extras/8f5fe23f8cafe11fd5344c1eec528eaa.poster.avif?t=1735781367\" width=240 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793270/extras/8f5fe23f8cafe11fd5344c1eec528eaa.webm?t=1735781367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793270/extras/8f5fe23f8cafe11fd5344c1eec528eaa.mp4?t=1735781367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
